TITLE Mixing DIC and Ca solutions, heating with calcite eq
SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50 charge
SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
MIX 1
    1 1
    2 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps
SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -si Calcite
USER_PUNCH 1
    -headings log_IAP_Calcite
    -start
    10 PUNCH SI("Calcite") + LOG10(10)
    -end
END